    "done_when": "InkStyle gains path_simplify_threshold (default 1.0) and trace_max_points (default 4000); imas_ink.io.render_to_bytes saves under matplotlib's rc_context with path.simplify True and path.simplify_threshold set from the style, adding no other matplotlib code path; imas_ink/_decimate.py holds one private function that splits a series into trace_max_points/2 consecutive equal-count bins and returns each bin's minimum and maximum sample in time order; _render_timeseries_alt draws a series longer than trace_max_points through that envelope and a shorter one unchanged; tests/unit/test_trace_resolution.py renders a 300,000-sample TimeSeries through time_trace_figure_mpl and render_to_bytes(format='svg') and asserts the SVG is under 100 KB, asserts the altair renderer emits at most trace_max_points points for that series and still reaches its global minimum and maximum, and asserts a series shorter than the limit is drawn in altair with all its samples; 'uv run --no-sync pytest -p no:cacheprovider tests/unit' adds no failure against the base revision, and 'uv run --no-sync ruff check imas_ink tests' adds no finding against the base revision",
    "estimated_hours": 1.0,
    "goal": "Bound trace figures to display resolution through matplotlib path simplification and an altair min/max envelope",
